ial NOS|nitric oxide synthase 3 (endothelial cell)","nomenclaturesymbol":"NOS3","nomenclaturename":"nitric oxide synthase 3","nomenclaturestatus":"Official","mim":["163729"],"genomicinfo":[{"chrloc":"7","chraccver":"NC_000007.14","chrstart":150991016,"chrstop":151014587,"exoncount":28}],"geneweight":248043,"summary":"Nitric oxide is a reactive free radical which acts as a biologic mediator in several processes, including neurotransmission and antimicrobial and antitumoral activities. Nitric oxide is synthesized from L-arginine by nitric oxide synthases. Variations in this gene are associated with susceptibility to coronary spasm. Alternative splicing and the use of alternative promoters results in multiple transcript variants. [provided by RefSeq, Oct 2016]","chrsort":"07","chrstart":150991016,"organism":{"scientificname":"Homo sapiens","commonname":"human","taxid":9606},"locationhist":[{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000007.14","chrstart":150991016,"chrstop":151014587},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2025_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060931.1","chrstart":152163823,"chrstop":152187710},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000007.14","chrstart":150991016,"chrstop":151014587},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2024_08","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060931.1","chrstart":152163823,"chrstop":152187710},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_10","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000007.14","chrstart":150991016,"chrstop":151014587},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_10","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060931.1","chrstart":152163823,"chrstop":152187710},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_03","assemblyaccver":"GCF_000001405.40","chraccver":"NC_000007.14","chrstart":150991016,"chrstop":151014587},{"annotationrelease":"RS_2023_03","assemblyaccver":"GCF_009914755.1","chraccver":"NC_060931.1","chrstart":152163823,"chrstop":1521877